    "Some file formats and device drivers are based on the source code of these projects:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einige Dateiformate und Gerätetreiber beruhen auf dem Quellcode dieser Projekte:"
